The AEGIS observability stack should conceptually follow:

```text
AEGIS SERVICES
      │
      ├── Logs
      ├── Metrics
      ├── Traces
      └── Health Signals
              │
              ▼
       OBSERVABILITY PIPELINE
              │
              ├── Collection
              ├── Processing
              ├── Storage
              └── Retention
              │
              ▼
       OBSERVABILITY PLATFORM
              │
              ├── Dashboards
              ├── Alerts
